    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is it possible to have line breaks in axis labels?  For example, in the minimal example below, I want the &quot;A very long title\\nI want to break&quot; to break into two lines after title, but at some point ggvis has cleaned out the &#39;\\n&#39; from the string and it is just ignored.  Thanks.<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>break_eg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Subject</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A very long title\\nI want to break&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Foo&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Value</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>break_eg </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   ggvis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Subject</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>   layer_points</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-Ml_dpercFZc/VNP_WGy62jI/AAAAAAAAAJs/ivUBLie1-3Q/s1600/linebreak_eg.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-Ml_dpercFZc/VNP_WGy62jI/AAAAAAAAAJs/ivUBLie1-3Q/s1600/linebreak_eg.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484522428000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZRKN4LeGYQryzYKi5ArRs\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-Ml_dpercFZc/VNP_WGy62jI/AAAAAAAAAJs/ivUBLie1-3Q/s320/linebreak_eg.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"155\"></a></p><div><br><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
