     "<div lang=\"EN-NZ\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Hi – no, I don’t think it’s moved on from when I had the initial request.  It is a known issue in the backlog, but development seems to have gone on ice with ggvis from Hadley and co, and I don’t have the time (or quite the right skills) to hop in and try and fix it myself.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Cheers<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>PE<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
